# Runtime data — never commit. Holds live orders (customer names, phone
# numbers, addresses) and the admin password hash / WhatsApp API keys.
data/

# Product photography IS tracked, deliberately.
#
# On a host without a persistent disk (Render's free plan, most container
# platforms) anything written at runtime is destroyed on every deploy and every
# idle spin-down. Photographs committed here are part of the build instead, so
# they survive. See docs/CATALOG.md for the workflow.

# Local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.log
*.tmp

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
